======================================================================
18. WIRE-FORMAT FIELD ORDER
======================================================================

The JSON formats shown in this specification are the normative v1 wire
format. Field order must be preserved.

In particular:

X#WEB-n|{"type":"spot","payload":"<payload>"}
R#WEB-n|{"type":"rbn","payload":"<payload>"}
N#WEB-n|{"type":"ann","payload":"<payload>"}

Responses use:

{"type":"response","id":<id>,"status":"<status>","action":"<action>",...}

Protocol v1 uses only "ann" on the WC interface. "announce" may only
appear internally as the native DXSpider command name.
